      "body": "## Motivation\n\nContinues #27199, which was closed by inactivity automation. GitHub rejected reopening the original PR.\n\nBatch slicing still drops `routing_key` on current main (`a52ee805`). This loses the request affinity key for batched and parallel-sampling requests. `require_reasoning` is already forwarded upstream, so the implementation is now limited to the remaining routing-key bug.\n\n## Modifications\n\nForward `routing_key` when constructing each sliced request. Test ordinary batches and `n=2` sampling with unset, empty and nonempty keys; retain reasoning metadata checks.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nThe new regression fails on unmodified main for four subcases. With the fix, the full CPU io_struct suite passes (64 tests, 2 skipped, 16 subtests). No model-forward changes; GPU serving is not validated locally.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo benchmark claim; one existing request field is forwarded. Upstream CI is pending after reopening.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Add unit tests.\n- [x] Check changed-file formatting and lint.\n- [ ] Upstream CI and maintainer review.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41354105088](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41354105088)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41354105579](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41354105579)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41354105167](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41354105167)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sgla